          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Gojo introducing his usual confidence; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This hypothetical disables his technique for twenty-four hours. No upgrade. Use the syllabus.",
      "label": "ONE INVENTED BAD DAY",
      "start": 4.319172113289761,
      "end": 8.953976034858389,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-fight",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Gojo combat footage contrasted with the hypothetical loss of technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yuji suggests hiding him. Gojo calls it a lesson. My guy, impressive rebrand for embarrassment.",
      "label": "YUJI GETS WORRIED",
      "start": 8.953976034858389,
      "end": 13.688453159041396,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-yuji",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Yuji reacting as a student; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-yuji",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Yuji reacting as a student; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Megumi asks who knows he's vulnerable. Announcing it? A beautifully stupid marketing campaign.",
      "label": "MEGUMI READS THE ROOM",
      "start": 13.688453159041396,
      "end": 18.090686274509803,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-megumi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Megumi thinking through a plan; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gojo keeps experience and judgment. We removed a technique, not his brain. No personality factory reset.",
      "label": "POWER IS NOT ALL HE KNOWS",
      "start": 18.090686274509803,
      "end": 23.439814814814817,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-gojo",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Gojo introducing his usual confidence; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-gojo",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Gojo introducing his usual confidence; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They change the objective. Evacuate people, limit exposure, avoid direct fights. Reach tomorrow intact.",
      "label": "CHANGE THE OBJECTIVE",
      "start": 23.439814814814817,
      "end": 28.63943355119826,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-megumi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Megumi thinking through a plan; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-megumi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Megumi thinking through a plan; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yuji wants to rescue everyone alone. Strong instincts, brother. Terrible delivery policy for handing yourself to enemies.",
      "label": "NO HEROIC DETOUR",
      "start": 28.63943355119826,
      "end": 34.43709150326797,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-yuji",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Yuji reacting as a student; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-yuji",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Yuji reacting as a student; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A threat appears. Instead of overpowering it, they use a decoy and escape route.",
      "label": "THE WRONG BATTLE",
      "start": 34.43709150326797,
      "end": 37.859204793028326,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-fight",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Gojo combat footage contrasted with the hypothetical loss of technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Megumi handles the route. Yuji moves people. Gojo calls timing. Students become participants, not spectators.",
      "label": "THE PLAN NEEDS EVERYBODY",
      "start": 37.859204793028326,
      "end": 43.57380174291939,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-megumi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Megumi thinking through a plan; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-gojo-no-powers-day-01-megumi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Megumi thinking through a plan; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gojo must trust his teaching. Incredible. Education has reached its terrifying practical application. Somebody check the syllabus.",
      "label": "THE TEACHER HAS TO TRUST",
      "start": 43.57380174291939,
